<lb n="31"/>dero underthaenigster burger <persName resp="#ner">Johannes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deller</unclear></persName>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eroeffnung</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/>Es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> sich die selb noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erinneren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiß</unclear>, welcher
