<lb n="46"/>moechte werden, doch sonderlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">groesses</unclear> vertrawen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mier</unclear>
